From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: qcom-haptics: update __assign_str for Linux 7.1

Linux 7.1's tracepoint __assign_str() macro takes only the field name; it
derives the source expression from the matching __string() declaration.

--- a/include/trace/events/qcom_haptics.h
+++ b/include/trace/events/qcom_haptics.h
@@ -84,7 +84,7 @@ TRACE_EVENT(qcom_haptics_status,
 	),
 
 	TP_fast_assign(
-		__assign_str(id_name, name);
+		__assign_str(id_name);
 		__entry->msb = msb;
 		__entry->lsb = lsb;
 	),
